# Environmental Statistics Portal

Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for full agent rules. Architecture: [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](../../docs/ARCHITECTURE.md).

**Quick rules:**
- Bilingual SPA (`/ge`, `/en`); charts via per-page `chartInfo.js` + `src/chartRegistry/` — no monolithic charts file.
- Every searchable chart: `chartID` on wrapper + `chartInfo` entry; pages use `useScrollToChartHash()`.
- Use `ChartStateCards`, shared `Download/`, `retryKey` refetch — not full page reload.
- Do not enable StrictMode in `main.jsx` without fixing double-fetch.
- Preserve UI/behavior unless asked; minimal diffs; run `npm run build` after substantive changes.
